DU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-13T14:40:27Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T17:05:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 580 2048SP (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.1000) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7500 CPU @ 3.40GHz (4 threads) - 15.96 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nShader uniforms with similar naming convention results in different capitalization in the inspector.\n\nFor example\n\n```\nuniform bool project_xy = true;\nuniform bool project_xz = true;\nuniform bool project_zy = true;\n```\n\nresults in \n\n<img width=\"323\" height=\"82\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd6fb9b8-c9f5-4ae7-bcc8-7b3b50760a3c\" />\n\nThe Y for ZY isn't capitalized.\n\nAlso group uniforms names don't follow the same convention as uniforms.\n\n```\ngroup_uniforms UV_Controls.uv_Select;\nuniform int uv_Select : hint_enum(\"UV1, UV2\") = 0;\n```\n\n<img width=\"485\" height=\"53\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d438d39-8b14-4141-9f09-7046a6a7fecb\" />\n\nSame naming convention but the subgroup doesn't capitalize.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTest different naming conventions with shader uniforms and uniform groups\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.githu